   "ruling": "Ruling: representation; i1040gi p. 38, worksheet line 3: \"Are you filing Schedule D? Yes. Enter the smaller of line 15 or line 16 of Schedule D. If either line 15 or line 16 is blank or a loss, enter -0-. No. Enter the amount from Form 1040 or 1040-SR, line 7a.\" With Schedule D the candidate enters the smaller of lines 15 and 16 when both are nonnegative and zero when either is a loss, which is the project's floored smaller. Without Schedule D the candidate enters line 7a floored and the project enters sd.distributions; when sd.filed is false (no sales, no 28% or section 1250 gain) sd.line16 = sd.line15 = sd.distributions and f1040.line7a = sd.to1040 = sd.line16, so the two are equal. Triage executable-triage-v1 (triage/qdcg.deepseek.json; 1,083 fixtures, 500 generated returns; no partial records, qdcg has no own inputs): all 1,583 comparisons agree (1,469 non-refusing). Project stands.",
